<Layout><div class="container py-12"><h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">About MimicryDB</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl">MimicryDB is designed as durable scientific infrastructure for documenting mimic–model interactions across the Tree of Life. Every published claim will require provenance linking an interaction to references and evidence passages.</p><h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Status</h2><p class="mt-3">Alpha prototype. The current website uses clearly labeled sample records while the normalized Supabase schema and curation workflow are developed.</p></div></Layout>
